          ],
          "image_path": "images/page_20_equation_3.jpg",
          "content": "3 0 \\times 3 0 \\times 1 5 = 1 3 , 5 0 0 \\mathrm { f t ^ { 3 } } \\approx 3 7 , 8 0 , 0 0 , 0 0 0 \\mathrm { c m ^ { 3 } } ."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
