          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "No, the balls cannot fit in the room without leaving gaps in between. Hence this operation will only give an upper bound value, i.e., we can say for sure that we cannot fit more balls than this."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 11,
          "bbox": [
            0.152,
            0.372,
            0.72,
            0.393
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Accounting for these gaps can give a better estimate."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "index": 12,
          "bbox": [
